WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
Can I hold it?

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.784
Only if you promise to be really really&nbsp;
careful (nervous laughter)

00:00:03.784 --> 00:00:06.600
I promise I will be so incredibly careful

00:00:09.418 --> 00:00:12.783
It feels absolutely incredible

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:15.073
This is the world's&nbsp;roundest object.

00:00:15.073 --> 00:00:20.641
If you scaled it up to the size of the Earth there would be no&nbsp;
mountain or valley bigger than 10 meters (30 feet).

00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:24.493
It was made out of a single crystal of&nbsp;
pure silicon-28.

00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:27.471
the raw material cost more than a million euros

00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:32.960
and its purpose was&nbsp;
to help redefine what a kilogram actually is

